@startuml
title Target return / full refund journey
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
actor Buyer
actor Inspector
actor Courier
participant FastAPI as API
database PostgreSQL as DB
participant "Private Storage" as Storage
participant "Scheduled worker" as Worker

Inspector -> API : final result
alt PASS/MINOR_ISSUE
  API -> DB : atomic result + certificate
  Buyer -> API : REJECT result
  API -> DB : one immutable rejection
else FAKE/NOT_AS_DESCRIBED
  API -> DB : negative result; no certificate / no CONFIRM
end
Inspector -> API : fulfillment command
API -> DB : TO_SELLER from frozen return snapshot
Courier -> API : upload selected private proof
API -> Storage : validate bound object bytes
Courier -> API : confirm assigned return delivery
API -> Storage : verify 1-3 selected objects readable
API -> DB : commit RETURNED_TO_SELLER + HELD + history/replay
group Separate settlement transaction
  API -> DB : lock / verify original charge and return
  alt settlement succeeds
    API -> DB : unique full REFUND + REFUNDED + Product CANCELLED
    API --> Buyer : full held-total refund reference
  else crash / transient failure
    API --> Buyer : returned, refund pending (HELD)
    Worker -> DB : bounded no-HTTP scan / lock / recheck
    Worker -> DB : same service: unique full REFUND
  end
end
note over API,DB
  Original successful Payment/Receipt unchanged.
  No payout, retained fees or automatic relisting on refund.
  Positive inspection certificate remains an inspection record.
end note
@enduml
